ents.txt`.\n - `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n \n-Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n+Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.txt` holds the resolved, hash-pinned versions (direct and transitive). The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`).\n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"README.md","time":{"start":1794382519715,"end":1794382519734}},"id":"prt_1c9885d9e001pFBPHVKgztFpqQ","sessionID":"ses_e368d1d2affeYlxFBJL2iz5sI0","messageID":"msg_1c987f3aa001aSDz0OuFNsCSLC"}}
